      "html": "<p>A driver cannot check brake pad thickness, disc condition, bearing play or shock absorbers from the roadside.</p><p>Light use, under 15,000 miles a year, usually follows the maker's service times. Heavy use needs checks every 6 weeks.</p><p>A good walkaround does not make up for skipped maintenance. You need both. This is a free van safety checklist for any operator, on paper or on a phone.</p>"
